# Only the tooling, the documentation and the analysis notes are versioned. Builds, source clones (ports/ and src/ are
# separate git repositories), game dumps, logs, the local install state and third-party mods stay out. The detailed
# security reports (review/) stay local until the upstream projects have merged the fixes.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/cp2077-mac.sh
!/README.md
!/MACOS_GUIDE.md
!/address-db/

!/_work/
/_work/*
!/_work/scc-test.sh
!/_work/addrdb/
/_work/addrdb/*
!/_work/addrdb/merge.py
!/_work/re/
/_work/re/*
!/_work/re/cpre.cpp
!/_work/re/re.sh
!/_work/re/dis.sh
!/_work/codeware/
/_work/codeware/*
!/_work/codeware/*.md

.DS_Store
